From 9a8d912837002d78fdd27ec0f0e53431e72d3f0c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Soaib Akhtar <soaib@example.com>
Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 15:11:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Replace FCITY branding with Property Planet logo across site

- New Property Planet logo (house icon + orbit ring, PROPER highlighted in teal, ty/et in orange) applied to all header and footer logo slots (logo_01-08.svg), color variant for light backgrounds and white variant for dark footer
- New favicon generated from the icon mark
- Replaced remaining hello@fcity.ai / www.fcity.ai / fcity.ai references with propertyplanet.in across contact page, footers, header, and root layout og:url
